OL,3,AEstonia to close Russia border
OL,4,Acrossings after attempted drone factory
OL,5,Aarson attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FEstonia has said it will close border
OL,8,Fcrossings into Russia from 1 December
OL,9,Fafter accusing Moscow of being behind
OL,10,Fan attempted arson attack at a drone
OL,11,Ffactory.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Kristen Michal said the
OL,14,Fbreak-in on Saturday at a facility
OL,15,Fnorth of the capital Tallinn was part
OL,16,Fof what he called Russia's "broader
OL,17,Fhybrid war against Europe".
OL,19,FThe alleged attackers were arrested,
OL,20,FMichal said, with local media reporting
OL,21,Fthe suspects are Latvian.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
